SG_Frightened\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Frightened\">SG_Frightened</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Condition\" title=\"SG Condition\">SG_Condition</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Fleeing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Fleeing\">SG_Fleeing</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/OverheadOnTurn\" title=\"Status properties/OverheadOnTurn\">OverheadOnTurn</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Missing_Pets\">Sources of Missing Pets</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Missing_Pets\" title=\"Missing Pets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Missing_Pets\" title=\"Missing Pets\">Missing Pets</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>FEARED</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Command:_Flee\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Flee_(Condition)\" title=\"Command: Flee (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command: Flee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Flee_(Condition)\" title=\"Command: Flee (Condition)\">Command: Flee</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has to move as far away from the spellcaster by the fastest available means.</li>\n<li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Fearful\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fearful_(Condition)\" title=\"Fearful (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fearful\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fearful_(Condition)\" title=\"Fearful (Condition)\">Fearful</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li>\n<li>It must run from the source of its fear and cannot take any additional actions.</li>\n<li>Targets can make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to shake off this effect if they end their turn out of sight from their source of fear.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Missing_Pets\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Missing_Pets_(Condition)\" title=\"Missing Pets (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Missing Pets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Missing_Pets_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Missing Pets</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cannot move.</li>\n<li>Affected entities have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202611\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3064/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37654/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9766/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.039/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1247061/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   73.966      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   73.966      1 -total\n 54.03%   39.967      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 23.75%   17.568      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 19.27%   14.253      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.71%   13.839     10 Template:Icon_text\n 16.85%   12.464     35 Template:Trim\n 16.28%   12.043      8 Template:Icon_link\n 13.15%    9.726      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 12.36%    9.143      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23738-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202611 and revision id 378826. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}